From: Senemos Maintainers <75160848+MCC45TR@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno: disable the TP UBWC flag hint for Adreno 732

On Uke with native DRM, image atomics and a multiple-image barrier test fail
with the inherited TP UBWC flag hint enabled. Disabling only this property
passes all three reproductions without disabling UBWC storage images.

Apply the correction to the shared device-info copy used by Gallium and
Turnip. Match the exact chip across fuse variants, preserve the X1-45 table
entry and retain explicit debug override precedence. No neighboring chip
properties or original device records are modified.

---
diff --git a/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_dev_info.c b/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_dev_info.c
--- a/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_dev_info.c
+++ b/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_dev_info.c
@@ -82,6 +82,9 @@ fd_dev_info(const struct fd_dev_id *id)
    const struct fd_dev_info *orig = fd_dev_info_raw(id);
    if (orig) {
       modified = *orig;
+      /* Uke image atomics/readback fail with the TP UBWC flag hint set. */
+      if ((id->chip_id & UINT64_C(0xffffffff)) == UINT64_C(0x43030b00))
+         modified.props.enable_tp_ubwc_flag_hint = false;
       fd_dev_info_apply_dbg_options(&modified);
    }
 
